          "full": "Aliceliese Lou Nebulis IX",
          "native": "アリスリーゼ・ルゥ・ネビュリス9世",
          "alternative": [
            "Ice Witch of Calamity"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b170214-xXIkbPqBZ4u4.png"
        },
        "description": "Aliceliese is a calm person and a kind heart to which she uses mostly to protect her family legacy. While she comes off as a cold fighter when she's on the battlefield, Aliceliese isn't much different from a normal girl her age. She enjoys going to the opera (having cried during one play), and is a fan of art and can be very talkative at times.\n\nBeing a teenage girl, Alice has some interest in the opposite sex. Not having many males her age around her, she expresses most of this interest in [Iska](https://anilist.co/character/170215/Iska) when they're not on the battlefield. She even treats their rivalry as something similar to a relationship, as [Rin](https://anilist.co/character/180987/Vispose-Rin) compared the way she was planning for their final battle to planning for a wedding.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "17"
      },
